# Tests + docs must NEVER ship in deployed worker images. The Dockerfile bakes `COPY worker/`,
# which would otherwise include *.test.js and any *.md docs. Excluding them from the build
# context keeps them out. (Docs live in /design at the repo root — never inside worker/.)
**/*.test.js
**/*.spec.js
**/__tests__/
**/*.md

# Build-context hygiene: the image runs its own `npm install`, so host deps aren't needed, and
# these only bloat/slow the build context. (Worker images COPY only package.json, worker/,
# config/, and docker/common/start.sh.)
**/node_modules
.git
*.log
